{"at":"-","bindings":"~/beyond10x/sdc/driver/examples/sdc/sdc-intake.bindings.json","event":"opened","ir":"e7307534b1f00c6bb9e06b431c5a76ef87c098c842dba2669d8ab84c7a99ffb4","prev":null,"protocol":{"description":"Turn an idea into a requirements list (docs/phases.md steps 1 to 3). The idea record is checked against its schema; the idea is dissected into typed items (fact, wish, belief, unknown, ambiguity, dark spot), each citing its span of the idea; every open item becomes an interview question with a default answer, accepted as is or changed, every scope-changing one by a human; the answers are normalised into a requirements list. Every result is a program's exit status, never an LLM's word. A revised idea invalidates the dissection check, a revised dissection the interview check, a revised interview the requirements check. The case ends passed; abandoning the idea is the root case's decision.","id":"sdc.intake","revision":4},"seq":0}
